    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omunabii yabisulilwa omufwano kweihekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuyika kwamakhumi kabili nakharaano kwobwarwi bweefwe, mukhuchaaka khwomuyika, omwesi nikuli ekhumi, mumuyika kwekhumi nakhane olunyuma Iwokhuhulwa khwelitookho, khunyanga eyo omukhono kwOMWAMI kwali khwisie, niyambila yaho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mumabisulo, Nyasaye yambila mushialo shiaIsiraeli niyara khushikulu eshirambi muno, ewa omufwano kwelitookho kwandoleshela enasautsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyambilayo, ne lola, omundu ngwoyo; okhulolekhakhwe khweenga shinga okhulolekha khwomukasa, nali nende olutsaha Iweikitani mumukhono, nelitundu eliokhuchela; nasinjiile hashilibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu tsana niyasunjila mbu Mwana womundu, henga netsimonitsio ohulile namarwiko, norakhwo omwoyo khukosi aka ndalakhumanyia; shichila oleerilwe hano ekhumanyie amakhuwa kandi; nawe orumbulile inzu yaIsiraeli kosi aka olalola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, olukoba lwaliho okhubotokhana ihekalu yosi; ne litundu eliokhuchela eliali mumukhono kwomundu tsana lwahela amakhono kasasaba amarambi, mbu buli mukhono nikumeetilwakhwo obubambalifu bweshikalo. Kho yachela obubambalifu bwolukoba tsana, mbu litundu elala; noburambi bwalwo, litundu elala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyoola khushilibwa eshihenga ebukwe, naniina khumaniinilo kashio; nachela obwelu bwene bwomushilibwa, litundu elala obuchiikha bwabwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli khakoro khabalindi khahela litundu elala oburambi, nelitundu elala obuchiikha; nahakari worukoro tsana rubili rubili hahela amakhono karaano; nobwelu bwomushilibwa hashirookoola shieshilibwa enanzu, bwahela litundu elala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yachela nende eshirookoola shieshilibwa enanzu, mbu amakhono munaane; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nemisiilo chiashio, amakhono kabili; nashio eshirookoola shieshilibwa shiahenga enanzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orukoro rweshilibwa shiebukwe rwali rutaru elubeka, narutaru elubeka; rwosi rutaru rwali oruhelani; nemisiilo nachio chiali emihelani, elubeka eyi nende eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nachela omuliango kweshilibwa, amakhono ekhumi; ne obubambalifu bweshilibwa bwahela amakhono ekhumi nakataru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaliho omushingachi imbeli worukoro omukhono mulala elubeka eyi nende eyi; narwo orukoro, amakhono kasasaba elubeka eyi namakhono kasasaba elubeka eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nachela eshilibwa okhurula khwisiisi lielwanyi eliakhakoro khalala okhuula khwisiisi lielwanyi liakhakoro khandi, obuchiikha amakhono amakhumi kabili nakaraano, okhurula khumuliango okhuula khumuliango kundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yachela nende eshirookoola, amakhono amakhumi kabili; nalwo olwanyi lwali imbeli weshirookoola shieshilibwa tsimbeka tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhurula khubwinjililo bweshilibwa, hambeli washio, okhuula khushihesi shieshirookoola shiomukari mushilibwa, hahela amakhono karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshilibwa shiali nende ebianzwi ebianyelehala elwanyi, mumisiilo chiorukoro; eshirookoola nashio shiali nebianzwi mukari tsimbeka tsiosi; ne buli kusiilo kwalikhwo eshifwanani shiomushindu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyambila mulwanyi Iwelwanyi, ne lola, ebisika mbiebio, nobwelu bwamachina mulwanyi tsimbeka tsiosi; ebisika amakhumi kataru bialiho habwelu bwamachina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwelu bwamachina bwarondokhana nebilibwa, elubeka, nibuhelana nebilibwa oburambi; obwo nobwelu bwamachina obwahasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nachela oburambi okhurula imbeli weshilibwa shiahasi, mukari washio, okhuula imbeli wolwanyi Iwomukari, elwanyi washio; mbu amakhono eshikhumi, ebukwe nende enotsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yanzimilila niyambila enotsi, ne shieshio, eshilibwa shiolwanyi Iwelwanyi, eshihenga enanotsi; nachela oburambi nende obuchiikha bwalwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nashio shiali nende orukoro rwabalindi, rutaru elubeka eyi norutaru elubeka eyi; ne emisiilo chiashio neshirookoola shiashio biahelana nende ebieshilibwa shiambeli; mbu oburambi bwashio amakhono amakhumi karaano, nobuchiikha amakhono amakhumi kabili nakaraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabio ebianzwi biashio, neshirookoola shiashio, nemishindu chiashio, biahelana nende ebieshilibwa eshihenga ebukwe; abandu baniinilanga khumaniinilo musaafu, niboola khushirookoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shialilo eshilibwa shiolwznye olwomukari eshihengana neshilibwa shindi, elubeka Iwenotsi, shinga eshielubeka Iwebukwe; naye nachela okhurula khushilibwa okhuula khushilibwa, mbu amakhono eshikhumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyanzimilila enasautsi, ne lola, eshilibwa shieshio, eshihenga enasautsi; nachela emisiilo chiashio neshirookoola shiashio; nabio nibihelana nende ebindi obukhongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bialiho ebianzwi mushio nomushirookoola shiashio tsimbeka tsiosi, shinga ebianzwi bilia; oburambi nibuba amakhono amakhumi karaano, nobuchiikha amakhono amakhumi kabili nakaraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaliho amaniinilo musaafu okhuniinilakhwo, mana niboola khushirookoola; nashio shiali nende ebifwanani biemishindu khumisiilo chiashio, shilala elubeka nashilala elubeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shialiho eshilibwa shiolwanyi olwomukari esautsi; naye nachela okhurula khushilibwa okhuula khushilibwa, enasautsi, amakhono eshikhumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
