              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyambila hashirookoola shieihekalu, nachela buli kusiilo kweshirookoola, mbu amakhono karaano elubeka eyi, namakhono karaano elubeka eyi; eshilibwa nishihela amakhono ekhumi nakane obuchiikha bwashio, nelisiisi lieshilibwa amakhono kataru elubeka eyi, namakhono kataru elubeka eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburambi bweshirookoola bwahela amakhono amakhumi kabili, nobuchiikha amakhono ekhumi nakabili, ne shiali namaniinilo ekhumi akokhuniinilakhwo; ne tsialiho tsisiilo halala nende emisiilo tsana, ndala elubeka eyi, neyindi elubeka eyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.49",
